<%- include('../partials/head',{title:'How It Works'}) %><%- include('../partials/public-nav') %><main class="public-page"><section class="page-hero"><div class="public-container narrow"><span class="eyebrow light">How it works</span><h1>A clear recycling journey with fewer blind spots.</h1><p>ReLoop keeps the customer’s estimate, the collector’s recorded weight and the final verified weight separate so each step stays accountable.</p></div></section><section class="public-section"><div class="public-container narrow"><div class="timeline"><article><span>1</span><div><h3>Create a pickup request</h3><p>Choose a material, enter estimated weight, pickup address, area, city, landmark and preferred time.</p></div></article><article><span>2</span><div><h3>Administrative review</h3><p>ReLoop reviews the request and approves it for collection.</p></div></article><article><span>3</span><div><h3>Collector assignment</h3><p>A verified collector is assigned or safely claims an available job. The platform prevents two collectors from claiming the same pickup.</p></div></article><article><span>4</span><div><h3>Collection updates</h3><p>The collector can move through accepted, en route, arrived and collected statuses, record collected weight and add private proof.</p></div></article><article><span>5</span><div><h3>Partner delivery</h3><p>The material reaches a recycling partner/facility, where receipt can be confirmed.</p></div></article><article><span>6</span><div><h3>Verification and completion</h3><p>ReLoop records final verified weight and completes the transaction. The customer can then rate the service.</p></div></article></div></div></section></main><%- include('../partials/foot') %>
